WEBVTT

00:14.700 --> 00:17.500
♪The Upper Three hold the seals♪

00:17.540 --> 00:21.380
♪A valiant general, an opera star, and a ruthless cripple♪

00:21.980 --> 00:24.420
♪The Middle Three stir the clouds♪

00:24.500 --> 00:29.140
♪A fiend, a wandering hero, and a master of the blade♪

00:30.540 --> 00:33.220
♪The Lower Three deal in gold♪

00:33.540 --> 00:37.500
♪A beauty, a seer, and a scholar♪

00:37.860 --> 00:40.780
♪The Upper, Middle, and Lower Three♪

00:41.620 --> 00:49.300
♪Represent the nine houses of old Changsha♪

00:49.900 --> 00:51.380
♪Together, they are known♪

00:52.060 --> 00:56.660
♪As the Mystic Nine♪

01:25.660 --> 01:31.900
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

01:32.060 --> 01:34.980
[Episode 4]
[This story is purely fictional]

03:22.590 --> 03:23.500
Keep watch on Unit 401!

03:30.670 --> 03:31.680
Fifth Master!

03:40.560 --> 03:42.650
All the capable ones are already down there.

03:42.840 --> 03:44.290
We useless lot should wait

03:44.520 --> 03:45.680
and see what happens first.

03:55.230 --> 03:55.900
Let's stop here.

04:00.120 --> 04:01.380
Zhang Qishan's soldiers

04:01.790 --> 04:03.020
seem neither human nor ghost.

04:03.710 --> 04:04.540
This wretched tower

04:04.560 --> 04:05.580
really is sinister.

04:07.070 --> 04:08.580
Who knows whether it has anything

04:08.790 --> 04:09.900
to do with that shadow he's chasing.

04:13.960 --> 04:15.180
After we came in,

04:15.710 --> 04:17.130
your attitude toward Zhang Qishan

04:17.690 --> 04:19.040
seemed to have changed.

04:23.320 --> 04:23.740
Yes.

04:25.150 --> 04:26.660
He does know what he's doing.

04:26.960 --> 04:28.130
I'm still testing his limits.

04:29.230 --> 04:30.020
Until I know them,

04:30.710 --> 04:31.460
I'll humor him

04:32.150 --> 04:33.100
and let him lower his guard.

04:34.960 --> 04:36.250
That sounds more like you.

04:39.040 --> 04:39.770
I'll go on ahead

04:40.150 --> 04:41.440
and scout the way for Ding Qiansui.

04:42.270 --> 04:43.410
We can meet up anytime afterward,

04:43.710 --> 04:44.300
the usual way.

04:45.510 --> 04:46.530
It's not time yet.

04:47.070 --> 04:47.660
You can't leave.

04:48.790 --> 04:49.250
Besides...

04:51.760 --> 04:53.370
I need your help too.

04:55.070 --> 04:56.210
I'll help you afterward.

04:58.630 --> 04:59.050
Madam Huo,

05:00.320 --> 05:01.330
Your Highness, Your Excellency,

05:02.720 --> 05:04.590
Your Majesty, Matriarch Huo.

05:05.760 --> 05:06.810
So many honorifics.

05:07.550 --> 05:09.490
Which one am I?

05:11.000 --> 05:12.180
That depends

05:12.280 --> 05:14.020
on which one you prefer.

05:26.440 --> 05:27.650
Haven't we been here before?

05:27.950 --> 05:28.330
Here?

05:33.550 --> 05:34.140
No, we haven't.

05:35.040 --> 05:35.460
Why?

05:37.070 --> 05:37.650
Do you think

05:38.760 --> 05:40.210
we might've passed through here

05:40.880 --> 05:41.370
when we were lost?

05:42.040 --> 05:42.700
Impossible.

05:43.760 --> 05:44.700
I have an excellent memory.

05:45.040 --> 05:45.860
We've never been here.

05:52.670 --> 05:53.370
Let's look farther ahead.

07:34.120 --> 07:34.540
Eighth Master,

07:35.600 --> 07:36.410
what exactly

07:36.510 --> 07:37.410
was that shadow just now?

07:39.600 --> 07:40.170
It didn't look human.

07:41.830 --> 07:42.540
What does the divination say?

07:43.760 --> 07:44.730
The results

07:44.990 --> 07:46.400
aren't very accurate right now.

07:46.830 --> 07:48.220
There's no sunlight down here.

07:48.600 --> 07:49.700
Tell us anyway.

07:53.750 --> 07:55.100
When did you hurt your hand?

07:57.160 --> 07:57.930
I don't know.

07:58.560 --> 07:59.410
I didn't notice.

08:02.140 --> 08:02.560
Huh.

08:03.240 --> 08:04.050
It's safe down here.

08:07.190 --> 08:07.700
Come on down.

08:08.190 --> 08:10.460
Stinky Yu, you went down by yourself.

08:10.830 --> 08:11.730
How am I going to get down?

08:12.190 --> 08:12.580
Eighth Master,

08:12.680 --> 08:14.050
why don't you come with us?

08:20.000 --> 08:21.140
That'd be great.

08:21.480 --> 08:22.220
Don't worry, Eighth Master.

08:23.190 --> 08:24.290
We'll keep you safe.

08:25.430 --> 08:26.250
Many thanks.

08:32.670 --> 08:33.100
Eighth Master.

08:35.670 --> 08:37.100
You scared me half to death!

08:37.310 --> 08:38.100
It's all right.

08:38.320 --> 08:38.930
You're safe now.

08:39.440 --> 08:39.940
Come on, get up.

08:40.910 --> 08:41.410
Eighth Master.

08:44.360 --> 08:45.370
Where did you go?

08:46.000 --> 08:47.010
Master Zhang told you to look after me.

08:47.200 --> 08:48.010
Yet you left me behind.

08:48.390 --> 08:49.010
Come with me.

08:49.480 --> 08:50.100
Come with you?

08:50.550 --> 08:51.940
Master Zhang told you to stay here.

08:52.390 --> 08:53.300
Why are we leaving?

08:56.270 --> 08:57.250
Where are we going?

08:59.320 --> 09:00.130
Wait, Yu.

09:01.630 --> 09:02.820
If you've got business to handle,

09:03.320 --> 09:04.580
I won't get in your way.

09:05.110 --> 09:06.720
I'll wait over there.

09:07.200 --> 09:07.950
Over there.

09:09.200 --> 09:10.180
I can't disobey Master's orders.

09:11.240 --> 09:12.340
You must stay beside me.

09:12.720 --> 09:13.290
Wait...

09:14.910 --> 09:15.460
Oh, dear.

09:37.600 --> 09:38.060
Fifth Master.

09:42.150 --> 09:42.650
Where's Master Zhang?

09:45.120 --> 09:46.650
Your Master had business to attend to.

09:47.080 --> 09:47.770
He told me

09:48.600 --> 09:51.700
to come back and take charge.

10:12.270 --> 10:13.370
They're still alive,

10:15.240 --> 10:16.490
but completely unresponsive.

10:33.000 --> 10:33.760
Laogou.

10:37.260 --> 10:37.660
Laogou,

10:38.240 --> 10:38.610
could they

10:39.240 --> 10:40.460
have been given

10:41.080 --> 10:43.060
some anesthetic?

10:44.030 --> 10:46.100
Could that be why their pupils won't constrict?

10:49.360 --> 10:50.650
Could it be

10:51.390 --> 10:52.650
that the shadow was controlling Unit 401?

10:54.480 --> 10:55.730
Now that the shadow is gone,

10:56.320 --> 10:57.580
Unit 401 has stopped moving too.

10:59.720 --> 11:01.100
But what exactly is that shadow?

11:02.080 --> 11:03.490
And how did it control them?

11:07.030 --> 11:07.820
Bizarre.

11:09.480 --> 11:10.650
Absolutely bizarre.

11:11.480 --> 11:12.100
Speak plainly.

11:14.480 --> 11:14.890
Laogou.

11:21.200 --> 11:21.610
Laogou,

11:22.270 --> 11:24.460
I examined them closely just now.

11:24.840 --> 11:27.250
Their breathing is extremely faint.

11:28.120 --> 11:28.890
Normally,

11:29.320 --> 11:30.730
they shouldn't even be able to stand.

11:31.600 --> 11:32.770
But every muscle in their bodies

11:33.000 --> 11:34.130
is completely tense,

11:34.480 --> 11:36.130
as if they're ready for battle.

11:36.640 --> 11:37.730
Are their lives in danger?

11:40.670 --> 11:41.730
For now,

11:42.630 --> 11:43.940
all I can say is they're still alive.

11:45.320 --> 11:45.850
But

11:46.670 --> 11:48.100
they don't look

11:48.480 --> 11:49.940
like they're possessed either.

11:51.270 --> 11:51.700
Laogou,

11:52.910 --> 11:54.890
given the situation,

11:55.320 --> 11:55.940
I think

11:56.320 --> 11:57.220
here's what we should do.

11:58.240 --> 12:00.650
We should lead Unit 401 out at once

12:01.270 --> 12:03.580
before they're controlled again.

12:04.000 --> 12:05.530
Master Zhang is highly capable.

12:05.960 --> 12:06.980
He can surely protect himself.

12:07.440 --> 12:09.100
We can leave him a message on the wall

12:09.320 --> 12:10.340
and wait for him outside.

12:10.870 --> 12:11.700
What do you think?

12:13.480 --> 12:14.530
I thought

12:14.670 --> 12:16.300
you'd become Zhang Qishan's lackey.

12:17.000 --> 12:18.180
It seems I misjudged you.

12:19.120 --> 12:20.940
I'm fine with that.

12:21.510 --> 12:23.340
I came down here to find Unit 401.

12:24.030 --> 12:25.010
Now that we've found them,

12:25.630 --> 12:26.340
it's time to leave.

12:28.870 --> 12:30.100
Are we leaving or not,

12:30.360 --> 12:31.610
Puppy Zhang?

12:32.670 --> 12:33.730
Until Master returns,

12:34.000 --> 12:34.730
none of us are leaving.

12:36.000 --> 12:36.420
Eighth Master.

12:38.120 --> 12:40.060
Before entering the tower, Master specifically ordered me

12:40.870 --> 12:41.730
to keep your mouth in check.

12:42.840 --> 12:44.770
Keep talking nonsense, and I'll seal it shut.

12:45.840 --> 12:47.180
According to our agreement,

12:47.670 --> 12:49.130
once Master Zhang returns,

12:49.270 --> 12:50.850
he'll have to leave the Mystic Nine.

12:51.510 --> 12:53.680
Surely he isn't planning

12:53.970 --> 12:54.710
to break his word, is he?

12:55.360 --> 12:55.820
Don't worry.

12:56.600 --> 12:57.820
Master will keep his word.

12:59.670 --> 13:00.180
Good.

13:01.270 --> 13:01.820
Then we'll wait.

13:03.390 --> 13:07.130
I'll await Master Zhang right here.

14:16.150 --> 14:16.650
That's strange.

14:22.320 --> 14:23.650
Only Unit 401's soldiers are here.

14:24.030 --> 14:25.250
The medics, patients,

14:25.600 --> 14:27.100
and the men guarding the entrance are all missing.

14:28.630 --> 14:30.490
Could they have split into two groups?

14:31.360 --> 14:33.980
Could someone have sent these soldiers out

14:34.910 --> 14:36.340
to lure us into a trap?

14:36.600 --> 14:38.650
Must you always suspect everything, Tiezui?

14:38.960 --> 14:39.940
Could it simply be

14:40.150 --> 14:41.890
that some of them couldn't keep up?

14:42.550 --> 14:42.940
Tiezui,

14:43.670 --> 14:45.730
why not just ask Unit 401 yourself?

14:46.150 --> 14:48.490
You and the Otherworld Patriarch are in the same trade.

14:49.030 --> 14:50.610
Perhaps they'll show you some respect.

14:52.790 --> 14:53.850
No need.

15:04.960 --> 15:06.180
Has the shadow returned?

15:06.790 --> 15:07.610
Then where's Master Zhang?

15:16.550 --> 15:17.610
They're being controlled again.

16:16.150 --> 16:17.220
Block them!

16:17.480 --> 16:17.890
Yes!

16:18.320 --> 16:18.850
Nobody move!

16:21.240 --> 16:22.060
There are only a few of you.

16:22.840 --> 16:23.700
How many can you stop?

16:25.480 --> 16:26.850
What do you suggest, Fifth Master?

16:29.480 --> 16:31.980
I say we follow them

16:32.510 --> 16:33.770
and see where they're going.

16:35.440 --> 16:38.180
I thought only Master Zhang would act rashly.

16:38.600 --> 16:39.730
But it seems, Laogou,

16:40.240 --> 16:41.300
your methods

16:41.510 --> 16:42.730
are no less audacious.

16:43.000 --> 16:44.420
Audacious? What do you mean?

16:45.390 --> 16:46.250
Didn't you say

16:46.840 --> 16:47.770
there must be

16:47.790 --> 16:48.610
a scheme behind all this?

16:49.510 --> 16:50.610
So let's follow them

16:51.360 --> 16:52.650
and see what it is.

16:53.670 --> 16:54.120
No.

16:54.720 --> 16:55.850
Master Zhang said that.

17:38.590 --> 17:39.140
Laogou,

17:40.000 --> 17:41.980
if they're moving

17:42.480 --> 17:43.860
under the shadow's control,

17:44.440 --> 17:46.140
why are they still moving

17:46.640 --> 17:48.700
when Master Zhang has gone after it?

17:49.920 --> 17:50.860
Even if it isn't the shadow,

17:51.880 --> 17:53.490
something else must be controlling them.

17:54.750 --> 17:56.570
Otherwise, Runty wouldn't be this frightened.

17:58.310 --> 17:59.220
I don't know why,

17:59.720 --> 18:01.220
but I feel like we reek

18:01.830 --> 18:03.220
like the dead.

18:03.440 --> 18:04.530
You're the one who reeks of death.

19:42.280 --> 19:42.860
Watch out!

19:42.860 --> 19:43.410
Nobody move!

19:52.960 --> 19:53.660
Where's Unit 401?

19:54.240 --> 19:54.810
Where did they go?

19:57.400 --> 19:58.770
They vanished in the blink of an eye.

20:10.240 --> 20:11.530
Did you hear any footsteps just now?

20:14.550 --> 20:15.490
The footprints end here.

20:16.240 --> 20:16.770
How could

20:17.830 --> 20:19.730
so many people just vanish into thin air?

20:21.030 --> 20:22.420
I refuse to believe this.

20:23.830 --> 20:24.380
Keep searching.

20:24.480 --> 20:25.050
- Yes. - Yes.

20:44.200 --> 20:44.660
Runty.

20:49.550 --> 20:50.050
Runty.

20:51.270 --> 20:51.770
Runty.

20:58.720 --> 20:59.490
How can this be?

21:00.750 --> 21:02.220
Runty can't pick up their scent anymore.

21:04.880 --> 21:07.460
Master, should we go back and check?

21:08.310 --> 21:09.220
Could we have

21:09.310 --> 21:10.380
gotten ahead of them?

21:23.310 --> 21:24.010
How could

21:24.400 --> 21:26.250
so many people vanish right under our noses?

21:26.400 --> 21:27.460
There were over 100 of them.

21:27.720 --> 21:28.620
Even if they'd vaporized,

21:28.880 --> 21:30.180
they should've left some trace on the ground.

21:30.270 --> 21:31.290
If they'd really vaporized,

21:31.680 --> 21:33.900
the trace should be on the ceiling.

21:41.400 --> 21:42.090
It's this tower.

21:43.310 --> 21:44.530
This tower is playing tricks on us.

21:48.830 --> 21:49.290
Laogou,

21:49.790 --> 21:51.250
everyone's at a loss.

21:51.830 --> 21:52.730
Say something

21:53.310 --> 21:54.380
to put them at ease.

21:55.110 --> 21:56.050
Exactly, Master.

21:56.590 --> 21:58.860
We're helping Zhang Qishan find his men.

22:00.160 --> 22:01.490
Let's not get everyone killed doing it.

22:52.270 --> 22:53.090
Runty sniffed the ceiling.

22:53.400 --> 22:53.940
No reaction.

22:54.480 --> 22:54.810
Master.

22:57.790 --> 22:58.460
Runty.

22:59.200 --> 23:00.900
How could their scent just vanish like that?

23:02.400 --> 23:03.380
That proves there's

23:04.350 --> 23:04.980
no hollow space above.

23:10.310 --> 23:10.900
This is bad.

23:12.920 --> 23:13.770
Tiezui was right.

23:14.880 --> 23:15.940
This tower has come alive.

23:17.310 --> 23:18.050
Remember how,

23:19.160 --> 23:20.220
deep in the woods,

23:21.270 --> 23:22.290
you sometimes

23:22.480 --> 23:23.570
come across ancient temples

23:24.270 --> 23:26.090
with human faces painted on the walls?

23:27.070 --> 23:28.050
The elders say

23:28.400 --> 23:29.620
that if a temple with painted faces

23:30.240 --> 23:31.250
stands in the woods long enough,

23:32.160 --> 23:33.250
it will come alive.

23:34.510 --> 23:35.730
Once someone steps inside,

23:36.590 --> 23:38.220
it toys with them endlessly.

23:41.720 --> 23:42.140
Tianpeng,

23:42.880 --> 23:44.050
remember that time we...?

23:52.440 --> 23:53.980
Tianpeng... Tianpeng!

23:54.790 --> 23:57.460
- Tianpeng! - Tianpeng!

23:59.000 --> 23:59.570
Tianpeng!

24:00.640 --> 24:01.140
Tianpeng!

24:05.720 --> 24:06.290
Tianpeng!

24:09.440 --> 24:09.900
Master,

24:10.510 --> 24:11.530
Tianpeng was just here.

24:11.920 --> 24:13.050
How did he suddenly disappear?

24:14.440 --> 24:15.770
Did Unit 401 take him?

24:16.240 --> 24:17.330
Enough of this trickery.

24:20.830 --> 24:22.250
I don't care what it is or what powers it has.

24:23.350 --> 24:23.860
Boys,

24:25.640 --> 24:26.490
split up and find Tianpeng!

24:26.720 --> 24:28.050
- Yes! - Search!

24:28.890 --> 24:30.220
- Tianpeng! - Tianpeng!

24:30.720 --> 24:31.460
Tianpeng!

24:57.340 --> 25:00.540
[Liunian Hall]

25:01.920 --> 25:02.420
Master...

25:03.880 --> 25:07.010
Master!

25:08.350 --> 25:08.900
Did you find him?

25:10.640 --> 25:11.090
Master,

25:12.070 --> 25:12.860
this gate wasn't here before.

25:18.030 --> 25:18.810
What's going on, Master?

25:19.350 --> 25:20.050
We haven't found Tianpeng,

25:20.350 --> 25:21.730
but this gate appeared out of nowhere.

25:23.070 --> 25:24.900
I'm afraid Laogou was right.

25:26.110 --> 25:27.290
This tower has come alive

25:28.070 --> 25:29.180
and is playing with us.

25:29.180 --> 25:30.420
[Gate to Liunian Hall]

25:30.880 --> 25:31.490
Juanlian, Tiezui,

25:32.640 --> 25:33.570
you two come in with me.

25:34.240 --> 25:35.860
Zhenyuan, you and the others stand guard outside.

25:36.350 --> 25:36.810
Yes, Master.

25:37.180 --> 25:37.920
Laogou.

25:39.240 --> 25:40.380
Do we have to go in?

25:41.510 --> 25:41.980
Tiezui,

25:42.790 --> 25:43.900
I won't force you

25:44.480 --> 25:45.460
if you don't want to.

25:46.440 --> 25:48.860
But the tower may invite you in.

25:50.000 --> 25:51.210
You've already seen

25:51.210 --> 25:52.000
how it invites people.

25:52.070 --> 25:53.460
I'd hate for you to be locked outside alone.

25:53.790 --> 25:54.930
Don't scare me.

25:55.240 --> 25:56.980
Zhenyuan and the others are out here.

25:57.070 --> 25:57.460
Fine.

25:58.240 --> 25:58.770
I understand.

26:00.350 --> 26:01.490
So to you,

26:02.240 --> 26:03.330
Master Zhang is still more reliable.

26:04.920 --> 26:05.420
Laogou,

26:05.590 --> 26:06.770
that's unfair.

26:07.510 --> 26:08.140
Fine.

26:09.270 --> 26:10.570
I'll go in with you, all right?

26:15.940 --> 26:20.100
[Liunian Hall]

26:50.160 --> 26:50.530
Tianpeng.

26:50.880 --> 26:51.810
Unit 401.

26:55.030 --> 26:55.530
Tianpeng!

26:56.000 --> 26:57.570
Unit 401!

26:58.030 --> 26:58.530
Master,

26:59.200 --> 27:01.900
do you think that creature is inside too?

27:02.270 --> 27:04.700
The tower itself is the creature.

27:05.000 --> 27:05.530
Will you be quiet?

27:14.030 --> 27:15.050
Runty stays outside

27:16.200 --> 27:16.860
to keep watch with you.

27:50.500 --> 27:52.580
[Liunian Hall]

27:58.550 --> 28:00.220
Stinky Yu, give me that.

28:27.640 --> 28:28.810
More trickery.

28:29.960 --> 28:30.900
There's no one here.

28:37.400 --> 28:38.140
Wait.

28:39.960 --> 28:40.980
This is very strange.

28:46.440 --> 28:46.980
What is it?

28:48.310 --> 28:49.050
The Thunder Patriarch Seal.

28:50.110 --> 28:52.700
It's a hand seal used to subdue evil

28:53.030 --> 28:54.330
and command spirits to uphold the Way.

28:55.680 --> 28:57.050
There's something behind this wall.

28:58.240 --> 28:59.180
Speak plainly.

29:00.160 --> 29:01.220
Laogou, look.

29:02.000 --> 29:03.250
This entire hall was built

29:03.960 --> 29:05.770
to suppress what's behind it.

29:06.470 --> 29:08.980
Whatever's there must be dangerous.

29:13.480 --> 29:14.380
By your reasoning,

29:15.310 --> 29:16.880
this hall appeared out of nowhere

29:17.510 --> 29:18.700
to lure us here and make us

29:19.310 --> 29:20.570
dig out what's behind the wall?

29:23.960 --> 29:24.660
I understand now.

29:25.680 --> 29:26.900
The Otherworld Patriarch sealed

29:26.960 --> 29:28.010
the tower's manifested body

29:28.270 --> 29:29.330
inside this wall.

29:29.920 --> 29:31.770
So the creature caused all this

29:32.070 --> 29:33.010
to lure us here

29:33.310 --> 29:34.570
and use us

29:34.640 --> 29:35.460
to break the seal

29:35.680 --> 29:36.620
and set it free.

29:37.830 --> 29:38.460
Impossible.

29:40.400 --> 29:41.380
That's not what it wants.

29:43.790 --> 29:44.770
How can you be so sure?

29:47.350 --> 29:48.420
If it truly wanted us

29:48.590 --> 29:49.810
to release that thing,

29:50.200 --> 29:50.980
then after we came down,

29:51.000 --> 29:51.730
the first place we'd reach

29:52.160 --> 29:53.220
would've been Liunian Hall,

29:53.880 --> 29:54.980
not those corridors outside.

29:55.510 --> 29:56.900
It wouldn't have made us chase Unit 401

29:57.310 --> 29:58.660
and then taken Tianpeng.

29:59.070 --> 30:00.420
If that isn't the case,

30:01.000 --> 30:02.460
why did this Liunian Hall

30:04.310 --> 30:05.250
appear at all?

30:40.960 --> 30:42.460
If it truly has some purpose,

30:44.750 --> 30:46.050
we'll know soon enough.

30:53.270 --> 30:53.660
Zhenyuan?

30:54.480 --> 30:55.010
Zhenyuan!

30:55.680 --> 30:56.140
Zhenyuan!

30:58.550 --> 30:59.180
Zhenyuan!

30:59.960 --> 31:00.460
Where is he?

31:00.750 --> 31:01.380
Zhenyuan!

31:08.830 --> 31:09.290
Zhenyuan.

31:16.750 --> 31:18.660
Zhenyuan, weren't you just...?

31:31.400 --> 31:32.010
Tianpeng.

31:34.640 --> 31:35.360
Tianpeng?

31:41.680 --> 31:42.140
Master,

31:42.640 --> 31:43.700
how did they get inside?

32:12.860 --> 32:13.980
[Liunian Hall]

32:24.400 --> 32:24.810
Master Zhang!

32:29.270 --> 32:29.980
Why are you here?

32:33.400 --> 32:34.180
Where are my men and my dog?

32:35.200 --> 32:35.900
I haven't seen them.

32:36.790 --> 32:37.220
What?

32:39.590 --> 32:41.010
Tianpeng! Zhenyuan!

32:41.440 --> 32:41.900
Zhenyuan!

32:44.200 --> 32:45.290
- Why are you here, Master Zhang?
- Tianpeng!

32:46.400 --> 32:47.570
- We were just inside... - Zhenyuan!

32:47.830 --> 32:48.660
But you weren't there.

32:49.110 --> 32:50.140
I chased the shadow here

32:50.550 --> 32:51.180
and never left.

32:51.830 --> 32:52.490
Where's the shadow?

32:53.110 --> 32:53.810
It got away.

32:55.110 --> 32:55.730
Wait, Master Zhang.

32:56.350 --> 32:58.290
Are you sure you've been here all along?

32:58.830 --> 32:59.620
I'm certain.

33:14.590 --> 33:16.050
Don't make me burn you down.

33:18.920 --> 33:19.900
What happened?

33:22.790 --> 33:23.490
Where's Unit 401?

33:43.350 --> 33:45.570
If this tower really plays tricks on people

33:46.070 --> 33:46.770
like you say,

33:47.400 --> 33:48.330
what does it want?

33:48.790 --> 33:51.090
Such beings are hard to fathom.

33:52.000 --> 33:53.180
They don't think logically like people.

33:53.510 --> 33:55.730
They often act on a whim.

33:56.750 --> 33:57.290
Zhang Qishan,

33:59.310 --> 34:00.530
what exactly was that shadow?

34:01.350 --> 34:02.180
Did you see it clearly?

34:02.640 --> 34:03.220
No.

34:03.960 --> 34:04.770
It was extremely fast,

34:05.720 --> 34:06.620
but definitely not human.

34:07.350 --> 34:08.420
No human could lose me.

34:10.590 --> 34:11.300
If it wasn't human,

34:12.590 --> 34:13.570
then it was a ghost.

34:14.590 --> 34:15.490
Now the ghost is gone,

34:16.440 --> 34:17.420
and my men have vanished too.

34:18.480 --> 34:19.380
How interesting.

34:22.840 --> 34:23.380
Here's the deal.

34:24.800 --> 34:25.650
From now on,

34:26.110 --> 34:27.010
you help find my men,

34:27.840 --> 34:28.820
and I'll help find yours.

34:30.280 --> 34:30.820
Then we'll

34:32.960 --> 34:33.530
be even.

34:38.070 --> 34:38.530
Master Zhang!

34:48.190 --> 34:48.900
It's hollow.

34:50.360 --> 34:50.860
Hollow?

35:01.510 --> 35:02.260
I hear water inside.

35:10.400 --> 35:10.780
Master.

35:10.920 --> 35:11.380
Keep going.

35:28.000 --> 35:28.690
It's a waterway,

35:29.280 --> 35:30.570
probably the building's drainage system.

35:31.800 --> 35:32.860
Could the shadow have gone in?

35:45.070 --> 35:46.570
Master, there's no echo.

35:47.230 --> 35:48.130
There's no telling how long

35:48.550 --> 35:49.260
this waterway is.

35:49.630 --> 35:50.460
It must

35:51.320 --> 35:52.420
run deep into the mountain.

35:53.760 --> 35:54.460
Fifth Master!

36:01.030 --> 36:01.860
Fifth Master!

36:04.070 --> 36:04.650
Tianpeng?

36:10.070 --> 36:10.840
Tianpeng!

36:11.040 --> 36:11.610
Tianpeng!

36:11.800 --> 36:13.650
Boys, grab your weapons! Save Tianpeng!

36:13.710 --> 36:14.530
- Yes! - Don't rush in!

36:19.000 --> 36:20.740
Tianpeng appeared too conveniently,

36:21.000 --> 36:22.380
as if he was being shown to us.

36:23.190 --> 36:24.280
Besides, the wall was sealed.

36:24.670 --> 36:25.740
How did Tianpeng get inside?

36:26.510 --> 36:27.820
It's hard not to suspect a trap.

36:30.190 --> 36:30.610
Master Zhang.

36:32.480 --> 36:32.940
Adjutant,

36:33.920 --> 36:34.420
scout ahead.

36:36.230 --> 36:36.570
Yes.

36:43.150 --> 36:44.460
If the tower

36:44.880 --> 36:46.490
wants us to go inside...

36:51.920 --> 36:53.940
But no one could fit through at this height.

36:55.570 --> 36:56.210
Master Zhang.

37:01.320 --> 37:02.130
What is he doing?

37:03.510 --> 37:04.460
The water is flowing.

37:05.190 --> 37:05.610
Eighth Master,

37:06.070 --> 37:07.200
I can lie on the plank

37:07.760 --> 37:08.980
and let the current carry me

37:09.840 --> 37:11.300
deeper into the waterway.

37:11.800 --> 37:12.210
Xiaojin.

37:20.960 --> 37:22.780
What's the thread for?

37:23.670 --> 37:25.050
It's a special thread from the Zhang Clan.

37:25.280 --> 37:25.900
It's extremely strong.

37:26.840 --> 37:27.900
We'll tie it to the back of the plank.

37:28.440 --> 37:29.340
That way, if I run into danger,

37:29.960 --> 37:31.050
you can pull me out quickly.

37:43.630 --> 37:44.090
Be careful.

37:44.800 --> 37:45.460
Don't worry, Master.

39:09.980 --> 39:14.140
♪The past fades like smoke♪

39:14.500 --> 39:17.220
♪A choice is made in silence♪

39:17.500 --> 39:20.300
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

39:20.700 --> 39:24.460
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

39:24.700 --> 39:28.140
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

39:28.420 --> 39:31.820
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

39:31.900 --> 39:39.180
♪But this could be our last trip together♪

39:39.620 --> 39:42.900
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

39:43.180 --> 39:46.420
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

39:46.580 --> 39:50.620
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

39:50.820 --> 39:54.180
♪Who believes in fate?♪

39:54.420 --> 39:57.780
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

39:58.020 --> 40:01.300
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

40:01.620 --> 40:05.300
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

40:05.500 --> 40:08.740
♪Take care♪

40:08.740 --> 40:11.300
♪We once raced♪

40:11.380 --> 40:13.300
♪For the dawn♪

40:13.460 --> 40:16.740
♪Ever-lasting bond, a satisfying vindication♪

40:16.860 --> 40:20.140
♪In the web of fate♪

40:20.140 --> 40:23.340
♪No one can escape♪

40:24.340 --> 40:26.180
♪Life and death cut like a blade♪

40:26.340 --> 40:27.900
♪We too were young once♪

40:27.980 --> 40:31.420
♪Fortunate to brave the raging waves together♪

40:31.620 --> 40:33.940
♪Keep the ember lit♪

40:34.060 --> 40:38.580
♪To illuminate the journey ahead♪

40:38.700 --> 40:41.660
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

40:41.900 --> 40:45.420
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

40:45.540 --> 40:49.300
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

40:49.620 --> 40:53.100
♪Who believes in fate?♪

40:53.260 --> 40:56.260
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

40:56.500 --> 41:00.260
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

41:00.420 --> 41:04.140
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

41:04.260 --> 41:15.700
♪Please, do take care of yourself♪
